title: AfterTutorial
---
Mem: We are back to the real world, Jade.
Jade: Let me go back. I still need to ask my parents many questions.
Mem: Even if you go back, you wouldn't get much out of it.
Mem: They are just fragments and will just remember that part of the memory.
Jade: But I finally get to meet them.
Mem: Jade, are you forgetting something? I used to work with them.
Jade: Then tell me everything you know about them now.
Mem: Ermm... You see I was asleep for many years. Some of my functions had gotten rusty.
Mem: Restoring that memory earned you 3 Memory Points. You can use them to give me an upgrade.
Jade: Upgrade?
<<cameraShift upgradeTarget 0.5>>
<<cameraKeep>>
Mem: Upgrading me will also help you during your exploration in the memory world and help me recover some memories.
Mem: Let's start with Echo Slot II. It lets you carry two Echoes instead of one.
Mem: Open Upgrades above me, select Echo Slot II, and buy it with your 3 Memory Points.
<<cameraReturn>>
===

title: Tutorial_Upgrade_Reminder
---
<<cameraShift upgradeTarget 0.5>>
<<cameraKeep>>
Mem: You still have one more lesson here in the shop. Open Upgrades and buy Echo Slot II for 3 Memory Points.
<<cameraReturn>>
===

title: Tutorial_Upgrade_Complete
---
Mem: There we go! Your second Echo slot is ready. You can now carry two remembered actions in future memories.
Mem: You've completed the tutorial. The photo puzzle is also available when you want to earn extra Coins for items.
<<cameraReturn>>
===
